### Variables
@host = http://localhost:4000
@apiBase = {{host}}/api
@contentType = application/json

### Test 1: Get Quable PIM Permissions
GET {{apiBase}}/permission

### Test 2: Get Quable PIM Scope (Alternative endpoint)
GET {{apiBase}}/quable-pim-scope

### Test 3: Install App
POST {{apiBase}}/install
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "quableInstanceName": "test-instance",
  "dataLocale": "en_US",
  "interfaceLocale": "en",
  "userId": "user-123"
}

### Test 4: Launch Document App
POST {{apiBase}}/launch
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "documentId": "doc-456",
  "documentType": "product",
  "mode": "edit",
  "quableInstanceName": "test-instance"
}
